  "description": "New Roof Dormer Loft extension with internal alterations to roof space.",
  "development_type": "Other house holder developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development, by reason of its scale, bulk, and design, would result in an overly dominant, incongruous and disproportionate addition that fails to appear subordinate to the host property and the immediate terrace, causing harm to its character and appearance. The proposal therefore would be contrary to D3 (optimising site capacity through design led approach) and D4 (Delivering Good Design) of the London Plan, Policy LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character) of the Hackney Local Plan, and the Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2025).&lt;/p&gt;"
